---
description: Web admin and mobile React/React Native conventions
globs:
  - web/**/*
  - mobile/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/codebase-explanation/frontend.md` before editing.

- TypeScript strict mode; functional components; named exports only.
- Web SDUI editor: `web/src/editor/`. Mobile renderer: `mobile/src/`.
- Run `cd web && npm run lint` for web changes.
- UI-visible changes: delegate `helm-ui-reviewer` and run proportional Playwright e2e (`qa/`).
- New SDUI components: follow skill `add-sdui-component`.

Protocol-first: if API/WS/SDUI contracts change, `helm-protocol` must define them before UI implementation.
